@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Lista sarcinilor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 2. Creează un proiect
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TaskFlow",
  "description": "Proiectul de curs"
}

### 3. Proiect cu același nume: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "taskflow"
}

### 4. Creează un al doilea proiect
# @name createSecondProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Website"
}

### 5. Creează o sarcină în proiect
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the API",
  "description": "Week 3 homework",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01T18:00:00Z",
  "projectId": {{createProject.response.body.$.id}}
}

### 6. Citește sarcina creată
GET {{createTask.response.headers.Location}}

### 7. Sarcină invalidă: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 8. Prioritate necunoscută: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad priority",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### 9. ProjectId inexistent: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task with invalid project",
  "projectId": 999999
}

### 10. Filtrare după status, prioritate și text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=Todo&priority=High&search=api

### 11. Actualizează sarcina: 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the API (updated)",
  "description": "Week 3 homework",
  "priority": "Critical",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-02T18:00:00Z",
  "projectId": {{createProject.response.body.$.id}}
}

### 12. Începe lucrul: 204
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### 13. Încearcă din nou: 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### 14. Finalizează: 204
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### 15. Sarcinile proiectului
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tasks

### 16. Sarcină inexistentă: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999999

### 17. Actualizează proiectul: 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TaskFlow Updated"
}

### 18. Nume deja folosit de alt proiect: 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{createSecondProject.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TaskFlow Updated"
}

### 19. Șterge proiectul care încă are sarcini: 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}

### 20. Șterge sarcina: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### 21. Șterge proiectul: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}

### 22. Șterge proiectul deja șters: 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}

### 23. Lista tagurilor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tags

### 24. Creează un tag
# @name createTag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Backend"
}

### 25. Creează un tag duplicat: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "backend"
}

### 26. Tag invalid: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 27. Citește tagul creat
GET {{createTag.response.headers.Location}}

### 28. Tag inexistent: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tags/999999

### 29. Durata de viață a serviciilor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/lifetimes

### 30. ArgumentException: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/boom?kind=argument

### 31. Excepție netratată: 500
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/boom

### 32. Verifică antetul CorrelationId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
X-Correlation-Id: TaskFlow-Test-123